[{"id":"addon:blood_bond:silencing_cloth","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"噤声布条","titleEn":"Silencing Cloth","rarity":"ultra","description":["五岁的夏洛特塞在自己嘴里的粗布条。这是为了避免有女巫猎人在附近时自己叫出声来。","·从休眠状态醒来后，夏洛特会获得20秒无法侦测状态。","无法侦测状态会隐藏杀手的气场、恐惧范围与红光。"],"flavor":"“我不喜欢这个游戏了，母亲……”——夏洛特·德赛斯","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_silencingCloth.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Silencing_Cloth","pinyin":"jinshengbutiao","initials":"jsbt"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:iridescent_pendant","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"荧虹吊坠","titleEn":"Iridescent Pendant","rarity":"ultra","description":["由迷雾铸造出的玻璃状吊坠。上面有玛德琳·德赛斯的肖像，不过她被描绘出的样子让人有些不安。","·在维克多休眠时将其击垮，逃生者会受到危险状态影响，持续45秒。","危险状态会使逃生者受到普通攻击时直接陷入濒死状态。"],"flavor":"“你们的牵绊并不是诅咒，宝贝们。这是你们赖以成长的力量。”——玛德琳·德赛斯","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_iridescentPendant.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Iridescent_Pendant","pinyin":"yinghongdiaozhui","initials":"yhdz"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:spinning_top","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"旋转陀螺","titleEn":"Spinning Top","rarity":"very-rare","description":["连体婴之间分享的一个木质陀螺，尽管维克多一直想据为己有。他现在知道，只要自己紧紧抓住并且尖叫的话，东西就归自己了。","· 维克多的猛扑会使逃生者掉落手中的道具。"],"flavor":"“乖……乖……这个给你好了。”——夏洛特·德赛斯","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_spinningTop.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Spinning_Top","pinyin":"xuanzhuantuoluo","initials":"xztl"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:forest_stew","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"森林乱炖","titleEn":"Forest Stew","rarity":"very-rare","description":["将青苔和树皮以及找来的蔬菜混合在一起的乱炖，会产生虚假的饱腹感。","·维克多移动速度增加0.6米/秒。"],"flavor":"“吃吧....吃吧，孩子。吃下去感觉就好些了。”--玛德琳·德赛斯","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_forestStew.webp","glyph":3,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Forest_Stew","pinyin":"senlinluandun","initials":"slld"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:victor_s_soldier","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"维克多的玩具士兵","titleEn":"Victor's Soldier","rarity":"very-rare","description":["维克多害怕时会紧紧抓住的玩具士兵。它的某些方面让夏洛特产生了嫉妒心。","· 维克多休眠时将其击垮的逃生者气场将显示6秒。"],"flavor":"“坏……坏……坏人……”——维克多·德赛斯","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_victorsSoldier.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Victor%27s_Soldier","pinyin":"weikeduodewanjushibing","initials":"wkddwjsb"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:drop_of_perfume","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"香水滴","titleEn":"Drop of Perfume","rarity":"very-rare","description":["玛德琳逃离过去的生活时携带的寥寥几件奢侈品之一。","它具有令人愉悦而放松的气味。","· 维克多休眠时，处于其警戒范围内的逃生者会受到浑然不觉状态影响。","浑然不觉状态会使逃生者无法听到或受到杀手的恐惧范围影响。"],"flavor":"“小心女巫的欺骗，她们最会利用男人内心的善良。”—— 女巫与恶魔的历史（1602）","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_dropOfPerfume.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Drop_of_Perfume","pinyin":"xiangshuidi","initials":"xsd"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:sewer_sludge","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"下水道污泥","titleEn":"Sewer Sludge","rarity":"rare","description":["德赛斯一家某次尝试逃出城市下水道时，身体表面糊上的恶心黏性物质。","· 被维克多抓住时，逃生者击垮维克多所需时间延长2秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_sewerSludge.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Sewer_Sludge","pinyin":"xiashuidaowuni","initials":"xsdwn"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:stale_biscuit","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"变质饼干","titleEn":"Stale Biscuit","rarity":"rare","description":["玛德琳从镇上的市场偷来的一块坚硬无味的饼干。虽然不算什么，但已经比大部分伙食要好了。","·猛扑冷却时间减少0.4秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_staleBiscuit.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Stale_Biscuit","pinyin":"bianzhibinggan","initials":"bzbg"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:weighty_rattle","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"沉重拨浪鼓","titleEn":"Weighty Rattle","rarity":"rare","description":["维克多一直哭着想要这个拨浪鼓，直到他妈妈把它偷了过来。这东西太重了，不适合放在孩子手中。","·被抓住后，击垮维克多，施加不治状态，持续20秒。","不治状态会使逃生者无法被治疗。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_weightyRattle.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Weighty_Rattle","pinyin":"chenzhongbolanggu","initials":"czblg"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:madeleine_s_scarf","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"玛德琳的围巾","titleEn":"Madeleine's Scarf","rarity":"rare","description":["玛德琳死前不久曾穿过的衣物。连体婴把它保存作为纪念物。","· 维克多移动速度增加0.3米/秒。"],"flavor":"“……在此纪念对良善正义的执行，以及对邪恶的消灭。” ——玛德琳·德赛斯的死亡记录","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_madeleinesScarf.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Madeleine%27s_Scarf","pinyin":"madelindeweijin","initials":"mdldwj"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:rusted_needle","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"锈蚀缝衣针","titleEn":"Rusted Needle","rarity":"rare","description":["玛德琳用来给自己孩子们缝破衣服的针。","· 被抓住后，击垮维克多，施加出血状态，直至被治疗。","出血状态会使治疗进度在中断治疗后回退，并使受伤逃生者留下的血迹增加。该效果会持续一段时间，或直至被完全治疗。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_rustedNeedle.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Rusted_Needle","pinyin":"xiushifengyizhen","initials":"xsfyz"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:baby_teeth","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"乳牙","titleEn":"Baby Teeth","rarity":"uncommon","description":["维克多很久之前缺掉的两颗牙。它们异乎寻常的锋利。","·被维克多抓住时将其击垮会施加障目状态，持续30秒。","障目状态会使逃生者无法看到气场。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_babyTeeth.webp","glyph":1,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Baby_Teeth","pinyin":"ruya","initials":"ry"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:ceremonial_candelabrum","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"仪式烛台","titleEn":"Ceremonial Candelabrum","rarity":"uncommon","description":["维克多碰倒的大烛台，并引燃了他的绑架者。这是他韧性的象征。","· 维克多休眠时将其击垮所需时间增加0.2秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_ceremonialCandelabrum.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Ceremonial_Candelabrum","pinyin":"yishizhutai","initials":"yszt"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:bloody_black_hood","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"染血的黑兜帽","titleEn":"Bloody Black Hood","rarity":"uncommon","description":["某个追杀夏洛特的人的兜帽。他很快就成了猎物。","·夏洛特苏醒时间减少0.5秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_bloodyBlackHood.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Bloody_Black_Hood","pinyin":"ranxuedeheidoumao","initials":"rxdhdm"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:cat_s_eye","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"猫眼球","titleEn":"Cat's Eye","rarity":"uncommon","description":["饥肠辘辘的德赛斯一家吃掉的某只猫剩下的眼球。维克多自己偷偷藏了起来当作玩具。","· 维克多在猛扑完全蓄力后不会发出声音。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_catsEye.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Cat%27s_Eye","pinyin":"maoyanqiu","initials":"myq"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:madeleine_s_glove","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"玛德琳的手套","titleEn":"Madeleine's Glove","rarity":"uncommon","description":["连体婴的母亲曾经拥有的一双手套。处境艰难的时候，它就会被塞在维克多的嘴里防止他出声。","· 维克多的警戒范围增加4米。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_madeleinesGlove.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Madeleine%27s_Glove","pinyin":"madelindeshoutao","initials":"mdldst"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:soured_milk","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"变质牛奶","titleEn":"Soured Milk","rarity":"common","description":["装满牛奶发出酸味的金属瓶子。维克多虽然很吵闹，但是看到自己的饭食就会安静下来。","·维克多的警戒范围增加2米。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_souredMilk.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Soured_Milk","pinyin":"bianzhiniunai","initials":"bznn"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:tiny_fingernail","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"小指甲","titleEn":"Tiny Fingernail","rarity":"common","description":["夏洛特有很多方式悼念维克多的去世。当他的指甲从腐烂的手上脱落时，她留了一片作为纪念。","·维克多分离时间缩短33%。"],"flavor":"夏洛特有很多方式悼念维克多的去世。当他的指甲从腐烂的手上脱落时，她留了一片作为纪念。","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_tinyFingernail.webp","glyph":2,"confidence":0.93,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Tiny_Fingernail","pinyin":"xiaozhijia","initials":"xzj"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:cat_figurine","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"猫形玩偶","titleEn":"Cat Figurine","rarity":"common","description":["让年幼的维克多目不转睛的木质玩偶。他一直尖叫，逼得母亲冒着差点暴露的风险从市场上把它偷了回来。","·显示猛扑的目标地点。"],"flavor":"让年幼的维克多目不转睛的木质玩偶。他一直尖叫，逼得母亲冒着差点暴露的风险从市场上把它偷了回来。","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_catFigurine.webp","glyph":0,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Cat_Figurine","pinyin":"maoxingwanou","initials":"mxwo"},{"id":"addon:blood_bond:toy_sword","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-22","title":"玩具剑","titleEn":"Toy Sword","rarity":"common","description":["只有几英寸长的小型玩具剑。维克多握着它的时候就有一种粗暴的快感。","· 猛扑蓄力时间缩短10%。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_toySword.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":1,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Toy_Sword","pinyin":"wanjujian","initials":"wjj"}]
